<title>USA: Plantronics declines comment on stock trade.</title>
<headline>Plantronics declines comment on stock trade.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday Plantronics Inc declined to issue any public statement whether there is any corporate developments which may explain the unsual market activity on its stock.</p>
<p>Plantronics stated that its policy is not to comment on unusual market activity, NYSE said in a news release.</p>
</text>
